 TGFB-signaling. The other pattern features high p-EMT expression in the core of tumor nests (“p-EMT core”). In p-EMT core tumors, we observe high co-localization of p-EMT cells with an inflammatory response program including neutrophils and macrophages, as well as differential expression of distinct ligands, including OSM. In vitro experiments demonstrate that OSM can induce the p-EMT state in multiple HNSCC models. Together these findings suggest that multiple p-EMT phenotypes exist across HPV-unrelated HNSCC and are mediated by distinct cell-to-cell signaling mechanisms, highlighting potential novel therapeutic vulnerabilities.","gpl":"34295","gse":"279017","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2026/06/21","suppfile":"TSV","samples":[{"accession":"GSM8559689","title":"93VU147T, 50 ng/mL IL-1B 72hr, Replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM8559672","title":"JHU-06, 50 ng/mL OSM 72hr, Replicate 1"},{"accession":"GSM8559686","title":"93VU147T, 10 ng/mL TGFB1 + 10 ng/mL TGFB3 72hr, Replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM8559683","title":"JHU-06, 100 ng/mL SPP1 72hr, Replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM8559687","title":"93VU147T, 50 ng/mL OSM 72hr, Replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM8559680","title":"JHU-06, PBS vehicle control 72hr, Replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM8559684","title":"JHU-06, 50 ng/mL IL-1B 72hr, Replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM8559681","title":"JHU-06, 10 ng/mL TGFB1 + 10 ng/mL TGFB3 72hr, Replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM8559678","title":"93VU147T, 100 ng/mL SPP1 72hr, Replicate 1"},{"accession":"GSM8559675","title":"93VU147T, PBS vehicle control 72hr, Replicate 1"},{"accession":"GSM8559679","title":"93VU147T, 50 ng/mL IL-1B 72hr, Replicate 1"},{"accession":"GSM8559676","title":"93VU147T, 10 ng/mL TGFB1 + 10 ng/mL TGFB3 72hr, Replicate 1"},{"accession":"GSM8559682","title":"JHU-06, 50 ng/mL OSM 72hr, Replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM8559677","title":"93VU1