y explain the limited benefit of combinatorial immunotherapy observed in clinical trials. We identify two subsets of tumor-reactive progenitor Tex (Tpex): ICI-responsive Tpex1 and ICI-resistant Tpex2, a subset characterized by KLRB1 and IL17R. The balance of Tpex1 and Tpex2 associates with ICI response across multiple cancers, offering insights into sustaining response. This study was registered at ClinicalTrials.gov (NCT03737968).","gpl":"20795","gse":"286827","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2025/09/02","suppfile":"MTX, RDS, TSV","samples":[{"accession":"GSM8730330","title":"P18_post_TCR"},{"accession":"GSM8730310","title":"P24_post_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730356","title":"P33_pre_TCR"},{"accession":"GSM8730293","title":"P14_pre_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730273","title":"P2_pre_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730336","title":"P22_post_TCR"},{"accession":"GSM8730290","title":"P12_post_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730316","title":"P27_post_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730353","title":"P31_pre_TCR"},{"accession":"GSM8730333","title":"P20_pre_TCR"},{"accession":"GSM8730313","title":"P26_pre_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730339","title":"P24_pre_TCR"},{"accession":"GSM8730302","title":"P19_post_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730319","title":"P29_pre_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730282","title":"P8_pre_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730345","title":"P27_pre_TCR"},{"accession":"GSM8730299","title":"P18_pre_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730279","title":"P5_post_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730342","title":"P25_post_TCR"},{"accession":"GSM8730276","title":"P4_pre_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730275","title":"P3_post_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730321","title":"P30_pre_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730296","title":"P15_post_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730322","title":"P30_post_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730318","title":"P28_post_GEX"},{"accession":"GSM8730335","title":"P22_pre_TCR"},{"accession":"GSM8730298","title":"