chromatin accessibility of AP-1 transcription factor sites and find that it regulates upstream MAPK signaling through induction Ras and Galectin-1. These effects sensitize ACTL6A over-expressing cells to inhibition of glycolysis by MEK inhibitors. Our results link SWI/SNF subunit amplification with potentiation of MAPK signaling in HNSCC and provide a novel mechanism by which cancer cells drive aerobic glycolysis and reduce mitochondrial dependency.","gpl":"34281","gse":"305164","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing; Genome binding/occupancy profiling by high throughput sequencing","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2025/08/25","suppfile":"BIGWIG, CSV, TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM9163270","title":"Control biol rep 2 SCC1 cells RNA-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163273","title":"siACTL6A biol rep 2 SCC1 cells RNA-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163280","title":"siACTL6A biol rep 3 SCC1 cells ATAC-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163279","title":"siACTL6A biol rep 2 SCC1 cells ATAC-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163277","title":"Control biol rep 3 SCC1 cells ATAC-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163276","title":"Control biol rep 2 SCC1 cells ATAC-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163271","title":"Control biol rep 3 SCC1 cells RNA-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163274","title":"siACTL6A biol rep 3 SCC1 cells RNA-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163272","title":"siACTL6A biol rep 1 SCC1 cells RNA-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163278","title":"siACTL6A biol rep 1 SCC1 cells ATAC-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163275","title":"Control biol rep 1 SCC1 cells ATAC-seq data"},{"accession":"GSM9163269","title":"Control biol rep 1 SCC1 cells RNA-seq data"}],"relations":[],"extrelations":[],"n_samples":12,"seriestitle":"","platformtitle":"","platformtaxa":"","samplestaxa":"","pubmedids":["40950224"],"projects":[],"ftplink":"ftp://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/series/GSE305nnn/GSE305164/","geo2r":"no","bioproject":"PRJNA1304528"},"200305473":{"uid":"200305473","accession":"GSE305473","gds":"","title":"Radiosensitizing effect of THBS1 knockdown in radioresistant head and neck carcinoma cell lines","summary":"This study aimed to investigate the radiosensitizing effects of THBS1 knockdown in radioresistant head and neck squamous cell carcinoma (HNSCC) cell lines. Using siRNA-mediated silencing of THBS1 in CAL27 and Detroit 562 cells, we examined transcriptomic changes associated with enhanced sensitivity to proton beam irradiation. Bulk RNA-seq was performed to profile genome-wide expression patterns in control and THBS1-depleted cells, providing insights into gene expression programs linked to THBS1-mediated radioresistance and potential therapeutic targets.","gpl":"24676","gse":"305473","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2025/08/21","suppfile":"CSV, RDATA","samples":[{"accession":"GSM9177657","title":"Detroit562 siTHBS1 replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM9177648","title":"Cal27 control replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM9177651","title":"Cal27 siTHBS1 replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM9177654","title":"Detroit562 control replicate 2"},{"accession":"GSM9177652","title":"Cal27 siTHBS1 replicate 3"},{"accession":"GSM9177655","title":"Detroit562 control replicate 3"},{"accession":"GSM9177649","title":"Cal27 control replicate 3"},{"accession":"GSM9177647","title":"Cal27 control replicate 1"},{"accession":"GSM9177658","title":"Detroit562 siTHBS1 replicate 3"},{"accession":"GSM9177650","title":"Cal27 siTHBS1 replicate 1"},{"accession":"GSM9177653","title":"Detroit562 control replicate 1"},{"accession":"GSM9177656","title":"Detroit562 siTHBS1 replicate 1"}],"relations":[],"extrelations":[],"n_samples":12,"seriestitle":"","platformtitle":"","platformtaxa":"","samplestaxa":"","pubmedids":[],"projects":[],"ftplink":"ftp://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/series/GSE305nnn/GSE30